/* Text */
hi
Hello!
end;
hello
Hello!
end;
sneeze
Ah- Ah- Ah- ACHOOOOOOOOOOO!
end;
shout
Aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaarrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrggggggggggggggghhhhhhhhh!
end;
yell
Aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaarrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrggggggggggggggghhhhhhhhh!
end;
scream
Aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaarrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrggggggggggggggghhhhhhhhh!
end;
troll-1
The glowing rock turns red-hot in midair and hits the troll, who
explodes into flame.
end;
scylla-1
The sword neatly slices the head from the scylla, who vanishes.
end;
dragon-1
The wand hits the dragon, who instantly vanishes.
end;
cyclops-1
The cyclops leaps back to avoid being hit by the spear, stumbles, and
falls into the abyss. There is silence for a moment, followed by a loud
>>> thud! <<<.
end;
basilisk-1
The weasel leaps into action and tears the basilisk to shreds, then
lays down and resumes its sleep.
end;
roc-1
The skin falls upon the roc, and with a loud, blood-curdling shriek
a disgusting liquid yellow smoke floats up from beneath the skin.
end;
coronis-1
The mudball falls to the ground harmlessly. The coronis, with a
yelp of panic, sinks into the ground and is gone.
end;
scorpion-1
The light from your flashlight reflects from the medallion as it
falls. The reflected light increases in intensity, and disintegrates
the scorpion.
end;
dark-1
The light from the liquid seems to be making the dark fade a bit.
In fact, the dark is vanishing (or at least becoming ordinary darkness)!
end;
end;

